<h1>Article 6
Zoning Districts &amp; Zoning Map</h1>
<h3 id="6-1" class="anchor"><span class="hang">6.1</span> Purpose
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-6/6-1&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-6#6-1'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	The purpose of this Article is to outline the different zoning districts within this Zoning Ordinance and to introduce the Official Zoning Map.</p>


<h3 id="6-2" class="anchor"><span class="hang">6.2</span> Introduction to Zoning Districts
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-6/6-2&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-6#6-2'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In order to carry out the purpose and intent of this Ordinance, the City of New Orleans is divided into the following zoning districts:</p>


<h3 id="6-2-A" class="anchor"><span class="hang">6.2.A</span> Open Space Districts
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-6/6-2/6-2-A&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-6#6-2-A'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>OS-N Neighborhood Open Space District<br>
OS-G Greenway Open Space District<br>
OS-R Regional Open Space District<br>
NA Natural Areas District<br>
GPD General Planned Development District</p>

<p>OS-CBD Central Business District Open Space District</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord.28275 MCS 12-19-19, ZD 81/19</p>
