<h3 id="8-3" class="anchor"><span class="hang">8.3</span> Site Design Standards
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-8/8-3&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
