<h3 id="9-3-A" class="anchor"><span class="hang">9.3.A</span> General Regulations
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-9/9-3/9-3-A&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
