<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Aug. 22, 2019, Zoning Docket 47/19, Ord.  MCS, Sec. 1; April 15, 2016, Zoning Docket 120-15, Ord. 26,866 MCS - May 27, 2016, Zoning Docket 018-16, Ord. 26,921 MCS - May 27, 2016, Zoning Docket 019-16, Ord. 26,923 MCS; Ord. No. 27,209, §1, Dec. 7, 2016, Zoning Docket 61/16; Ord. No. 27,707, §1, April 2, 2018, Zoning Docket 001/18; Ord. 28036 MCS, Sec. 1, ZD#112/18, March 28, 2019; Ord. 28176, Sept. 5, 2019, ZD 58/19; Ord. No. 28,156 MCS, §4, August 8, 2019, Zoning Docket 026/19 &amp; 027/19;  Ord. 28432 MCS, 8-6-20, ZD 38/20; Ord. 28696 MCS, 6-3-21, ZD 16/21; Ord 28943 MCS, 2-17-22, ZD 96/21; Ord 28905 MCS, 1-6-22, ZD 83/21; Ord. No. 28,911, §2, January 6, 2022, Zoning Docket 084/21; Ord. No. 29,126,  August 12, 2022, Zoning Docket 016/22; Ord 29157 9-15-22, ZD 030/22; Ordinance No. 29382, March 23, 2023, Zoning Docket 02/23; Ord. 29528, 7-24-23, Zoning Docket 13/23; Ordinance No. 29702, November 7, 2023, Zoning Docket 063/23; Ordinance No. 29946, 6-13-24, Zoning Docket 002/24; Ordinance No. 30060, 9-25-24, ZD061/24; Ordinance No. 30308, 4-29-25, Zoning Docket 093-24; Ord. No. 30558 MCS, 2-19-26, Zoning Docket 058-25;</p>
<h3 id="10-2-B" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B</span> Use Restrictions
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>



<h3 id="10-2-B-1" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.1</span> Existing Hotel Uses in the Vieux Carré Districts
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-1'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>Existing hotels in the VCC-2, VCE, and VCS Districts containing more than thirty (30) rooms may provide live entertainment subject to applicable ordinances relative to licensing procedures. All entertainment shall be within an enclosed structure.</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-2" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.2</span> Adult Use Restrictions in the Vieux Carré Districts
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-2&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-2'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	Adult uses are prohibited in the area bounded by Ursuline, Barracks, Decatur, and North Peters Streets.</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-3" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.3</span> VCS and VCS-1 District Floor Area Limitation
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-3&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-3'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In the VCS and VCS-1 Districts, a wholesale goods establishment is limited to twenty-five thousand (25,000) square feet of floor area.</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-4" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.4</span> Personal Service Establishments in the VCE District
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-4&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-4'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In the VCE District, massage establishments are prohibited.</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-5" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.5</span> HMC-1 District Floor Area Limitation
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-5&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-5'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In the HMC-1 District, the floor area of commercial uses is limited as follows:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 40px;">
	a.&nbsp; Commercial uses are permitted uses up to three thousand (3,000) square feet of gross floor area, unless conditional use approval is required per Table 10-1.</p>
<p style="margin-left: 40px;">
	b.&nbsp; Conditional use approval is required for any commercial use of three thousand (3,000) to five thousand (5,000) square feet of total floor area.</p>
<p style="margin-left: 40px;">
	c.&nbsp; Any commercial use over five thousand (5,000) square feet of total floor area is prohibited. This applies only to new construction as of the effective date of this Ordinance. The establishment of a commercial use within an existing structure that as of the effective date of this Ordinance has more than five thousand (5,000) square feet of gross floor area requires conditional use approval.</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-6" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.6</span> HMC-2 District Floor Area Limitation
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-6&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-6'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In the HMC-2 District, any non-residential use of more than ten thousand (10,000) square feet of gross floor area is a conditional use.&nbsp;</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-7" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.7</span> HMC-2 District Live Entertainment Limitation
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-7&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-7'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>In the HMC-2 District, a live performance venue and/or live entertainment – secondary use and/or outdoor live entertainment - secondary use is limited to one (1) per blockface.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord 29157 MCS, 9-15-22, ZD030/22</p>
<h3 id="10-2-B-8" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.8</span> T-shirt Shops in the Vieux Carré Districts
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-8&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-8'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In any Vieux Carré District, T-shirt shops are prohibited.</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-9" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.9</span> Cigar Bar in the VCC-2 District
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-9&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-9'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	In the VCC-2 District, cigar bars shall close by 9:00 p.m. on Monday through Thursday, or by 11:00 p.m. on Friday, Saturday, and Sunday.&nbsp;</p>


<h3 id="10-2-B-10" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.2.B.10</span> Breweries in the HMC-2 and HM-MU Districts
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-2/10-2-B/10-2-B-10&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-2-B-10'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>In the HMC-2 and HM-MU Districts, only breweries and distilleries that produce fewer than 12,500 barrels per year are considered permitted uses.</p>

<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord. 28696 MCS, 6-3-21, ZD 16/21</p>
<h3 id="10-3" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.3</span> Site Design Standards
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-3&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-3'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>



<h3 id="10-3-A" class="anchor"><span class="hang">10.3.A</span> General Regulations
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-10/10-3/10-3-A&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-10#10-3-A'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

