<p><sup>3 </sup>Only wireless telecommunications antennas that comply with the stealth design standards of Section 20.3.JJJ are considered permitted uses.</p>

<p><sup>4&nbsp;</sup>Established Multi-Family Dwellings that comply with Section 20.3.W.1 are permitted uses while those that comply with Section 20.3.W.2 are conditional uses.</p>
</div>

<p><sup>5</sup>As authorized in Article 22, Section 22.8.B.2.a</p>

