<p><sup>7&nbsp;</sup>Subject to the use restrictions in Section 12.2.B.5.</p>

<p><sup>8&nbsp;</sup>Established Multi-Family Dwellings that comply with Section 20.3.W.1 are permitted uses while those that comply with Section 20.3.W.2 are conditional uses.</p>

<p><sup>9&nbsp;</sup>Established Multi-Family Dwellings with a documented legal history are permitted uses in this district at any number previously provided.</p>

<p><sup>10</sup>As authorized in Article 22, Section 22.8.B.2.a</p>

