  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-14#14-3-B-5'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	Boathouses within the S-LM District shall be subject to the following design standards:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 40px;">
	a. All boathouses shall comply with the design and height standards and other regulations of Section 170-645 of the Code of the City of New Orleans, which shall prevail over any conflicting design standards and height, bulk and yard regulations of the S-LM District.</p>


