</h3>



<h3 id="15-3-A-1" class="anchor"><span class="hang">15.3.A.1</span> General Regulations
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-15/15-3/15-3-A/15-3-A-1&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
