<p>The EC-5 Sub-District applies to all lots with frontage on North and South Carrollton Avenues between Leake Avenue and City Park Avenue. In addition to the thresholds of applicability for development plan and design review in Section 4.5, the&nbsp; developments on lots within the entirety of each block located at the following intersections are also subject to development plan and design review:</p>

