<p style="margin-left: 40px;">iv. All lots with frontage on Holiday Drive between General DeGaulle Drive and Behrman Place.&nbsp;<span style="line-height: 1.42857143; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p>b. In addition to the thresholds of applicability for development plan and design review in Section 4.5,&nbsp; the developments on lots within the entirety of each block located at the following intersections are also subject to development plan and design review:</p>

