<h3 id="18-19" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.19</span> LAS LaSalle Street Overlay District
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-18/18-19&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
