         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>



<h3 id="18-19-A" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.19.A</span> Applicability
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-18/18-19/18-19-A&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
