<h3 id="18-22-B" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.22.B</span> Minimum Lot Area
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-18/18-21/18-21-B&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
