         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>Multi-Family dwelling developments within this district shall be allowed a minimum lot area of 535 square feet per dwelling unit.</p>

<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord. No. 27,406, §1, May 24, 2017, Zoning Docket 13/17</p>
<h3 id="18-22-C" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.22.C</span> Maximum Height and Floors 
