</span>
</h3>

<p>Main structures on applicable lots within the Annunciation Street Overlay District may have a height of up to 60 feet and may have up to four (4) floors.</p>

<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord. No. 27,406, §1, May 24, 2017, Zoning Docket 13/17</p>
