</span>
</h3>


<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord. 29577, 8-16-23, Zoning Docket 41/23</p>
<h3 id="18-31-A" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.31.A</span> Applicability 
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-18/18-31/18-31-A&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-18#18-31-A'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>The Brown's Dairy Neighborhood Overlay District applies to the following areas:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Those lots generally bounded by Erato Street, Baronne Street, Martin Luther King, Jr. Boulevard, and Carondelet Street.</li>
</ol>

