</span>
</h3>


<p class="ord-mod">Adopted by Ord. 29577, 8-16-23, Zoning Docket 41/23</p>
<h3 id="18-31-B-1" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.31.B.1</span> Prohibited Uses
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-18/18-31/18-31-B/18-31-B-1&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <a href="#" class="copy-link" data-html="true" data-content="&lt;input type='text' value='http://czo.nola.gov/Article-18#18-31-B-1'&gt;&lt;/input&gt;">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>a. Where otherwise permitted in the base zoning district, the following use is prohibited:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Bed and Breakfast Accessory</li>
	<li>Bed and Breakfast Principal</li>
	<li>Hostels</li>
	<li>Hotels/Motels</li>
	<li>Commercial Short Term Rental</li>
	<li>Non-Commercial Short Term Rental</li>
</ol>

