<h3 id="18-33-A" class="anchor"><span class="hang">18.33.A</span> Applicability 
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-18/18-33/18-33-A&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-print"></span></a>
