		<tr>
			<td style="width: 152px; height: 13px;">Sidewalk Uses (sidewalk cafes, A-frame signs, sidewalk displays)</td>
			<td style="width: 152px; height: 13px;">Any Zoning District where the following uses are permitted: Sidewalk signage and displays - all permitted commercial uses.&nbsp; Sidewalk cafes - restaurants (all types), bars, and retail goods establishments that serve food</td>
