         <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span></a>
</span>
</h3>

<p>
	Parking lot directional signs are subject to the regulations of Section 24.12.C.</p>


<h3 id="24-13-D-3" class="anchor"><span class="hang">24.13.D.3</span> Parking Area Identification Signs
<span class="utilities">
  <a href="/Print.aspx?printpath=/Article-24/24-13/24-13-D/24-13-D-3&amp;classname=nola.ordinance" target="_blank" data-toggle="tooltip" data-placement="top" title="Print this section">
